A typed probe of bots v51 and v52 in the C++ chat (coop_cli, family gate, thresholds 0.62 and 0.60), 2026-10-09, after
v52 was trained. The lines were written by the developer who wrote seed set v52, after the training: not seeds
(the four that are seeds are marked), not blind either. Lowercase without a final mark, as the voice chat gives the
classifier its transcripts. Found here: 'check fire' and 'check your fire' -- an order to stop shooting -- were
HOLD_FIRE 1.00 in v51 and are CHECK 0.60 in v52.

